    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.1,
      "end": 3.711,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "好的，接着我们来认识一位爱心好青年。",
      "score": 0.1591,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0533,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.031,
        "seg_cer": 0.312,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "好的，见到我们，应是一位爱心好青年。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.092,
      "end": 9.691,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一段时间，临川县大墟镇桂菊村的二十九岁小伙子廖永飞，",
      "score": 0.0656,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0632,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.056,
        "seg_cer": 0.08,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这一段时间，临川县大圩镇桂聚村的二十九岁小伙子廖永飞。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.892,
      "end": 14.538,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "因为免费为村里头的老人煮桂林米粉而备受关注。",
      "score": 0.0218,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0024,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.048,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "因为免费为城里头的老人煮桂林米粉而备受关注。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.58,
      "end": 21.252,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一善举源于两年前，他在直播当中为村里头的空巢老人煮米粉，",
      "score": 0.1341,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "善/三",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这一三句源于两年前，他在直播当中为城里头的空巢老人煮米粉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 21.278,
      "end": 23.709,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "赢得了众多粉丝的点赞，",
      "score": 0.0843,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1061,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.162,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "赢得了众多粉丝的点赞。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 23.961,
      "end": 30.447,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "也是从此开启了他每天为老人家免费煮粉的爱心直播。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "也是从此开启了他每天为老人家免费煮粉的爱心直播。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 30.836,
      "end": 35.649,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一坚持就是两年，免费送出共计两万份米粉。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0014,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
