        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这一坚持就是两年，免费送出共计两万份米粉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 36.04,
      "end": 43.276,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "每天清晨，廖永飞都会前往镇上的超市，精心挑选新鲜的猪肉、鸡蛋和水果，",
      "score": 0.1457,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0071,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.1,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.667,
        "phon_examples": "心/行 精/进",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "每天清晨，廖永飞都会前往镇上的超市，进行挑选新鲜的主肉、鸡蛋和水果。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 43.553,
      "end": 46.763,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "为老人们准备爱心早餐食材。",
      "score": 0.0727,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0676,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.067,
        "seg_cer": 0.083,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "为老鹰们准备爱心早餐食材。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 47.052,
      "end": 53.892,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "沸腾以后，廖永飞一边熟练的准备早餐，一边对着手机镜头与直播间里粉丝互动。",
      "score": 0.0554,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.121,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "废成以后，廖永飞一边熟练地准备早餐，一边对着手机镜头与直播间的粉丝互动。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 54.026,
      "end": 56.62,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "粉丝们热情的留言不断，",
      "score": 0.0,
